# Google IT Automation Lab: Handling Files & Report Generation

An end-to-end documentation of the Python file parsing automation lab, mapping the migration from raw data sources to processed text-matrix corporate reports.

## 📊 Overview

This project implements a modular file-processing data pipeline using Python 3. The pipeline handles CSV cleaning via custom tracking dialects, aggregates department staffing frequencies using native collections, and outputs a formatted flat-text report.

## 📁 Repository Structure

* `scripts/generate_report.py` - Core execution script containing custom dialect configurations, processing loops, and file streams.
* `data/employees.csv` - The input dataset mapping system usernames to corporate organizational branches.
* `data/report.txt` - Generated text log delivering alphabetical department tallies.

